cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite the preprint below."
title: "AXON: a sparse binary assembly network for direct synaptic measurement across a capacity range"
abstract: >-
  Implementation, sweep scripts and measurement logs for a study of memory
  capacity in a sparse binary assembly network, in which within-assembly
  synaptic density is measured directly across the load range over which
  sustained recall degrades.
type: software
authors:
